# FT10 Nonlinear ML Pipeline — Summary

## Experimental setup
- Phenotype: FT10 (AraPheno Study 1)
- N accessions matched: 135
- Feature panel: top-200 GWAS SNPs (from study1_ft10_top_hits.tsv)
- Model: RandomForestRegressor (200 trees, 5-fold CV, random_state=42)
- Grouping: gene-window ±25kb (Araport11)

## RF cross-validation performance
- Mean CV R²:  0.6484
- Mean CV RMSE: 10.55 days
- Full-data R² (in-sample): 0.7937

## CV metrics by fold
  - Fold 1: R²=0.7459  RMSE=8.037  (n_train=108, n_test=27)
